5,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's keep this simple. We have no data yet, so I suggest we observe everyone's communication style. Who wants to start by sharing their general approach?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,I agree with Shunichi. It is best to remain calm and observe from a distance for now. I will be watching how we all interact.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,I'm so excited to play with everyone! I think we should all be honest and kind to each other so we can find the werewolf together!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm not just going to sit around! I'll find the wolf no matter what. Let's just be direct and call out anyone who looks suspicious!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,A measured approach is always preferable. I shall listen quietly and see what patterns emerge from our conversation.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Takumi, being too aggressive early on can be a mistake. It often creates noise that the werewolf can use to hide.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,Shunichi is right. Recklessness rarely leads to the truth. We should prioritize stability over speed.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Takumi, let's try to be a little more patient! I'm sure we can find the wolf if we all work together happily!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, I'm not being reckless, I'm being brave! But fine, I'll listen for a bit. Just don't expect me to be quiet!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,I find the contrast in our temperaments quite interesting. It will be a useful metric for observation.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Since we've established the mood, I'm curious if anyone has a specific plan for when the Seer's information arrives tomorrow.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,I believe the Seer should be cautious. Revealing oneself too early is a risk we cannot afford.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,I agree with George! We have to protect the Seer. They are the most important person for the village!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"If the Seer finds a wolf, they should just say it! Why hide it? Let's just get the bad guy out!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, the wolf would simply kill the Seer that night. Silence is often the best shield.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Shunichi,,"It seems we have a general consensus on caution, despite Takumi's eagerness. I'll end my part here.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
