24,0,4,talk,Yumi,,I hope everyone has a wonderful night! Let's do our best tomorrow!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
