36,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Good morning. The first night has passed. Since the Seer now has information, does anyone wish to come forward or share a lead?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,George,,I suspect we should wait. A premature claim could be a trap set by the werewolf to identify the real Seer.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Um... I actually have some information. I'm the Seer, and I found out that Takumi is the werewolf!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Takumi,,What?! That's a lie! I'm not the werewolf! Yumi is just making things up to get me out!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"That was a very sudden revelation. @Yumi, your courage is noted, but such a direct claim is quite bold.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Yumi, claiming the Seer role and naming a target immediately is a high-risk strategy. Are you certain you want to expose yourself?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,George,,"It is indeed bold. However, if Yumi is telling the truth, the game could end right now.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"I just couldn't keep it a secret! I wanted to help everyone right away! Takumi, please tell the truth!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I am telling the truth! Yumi is the wolf and she's trying to trick us! I'm just a regular guy!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, your reaction is quite emotional. While that can be natural, it can also be a defensive mechanism.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Takumi, your defense is simple, but Yumi's claim is specific. Unless someone else claims to be the Seer, the evidence leans toward Yumi.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,George,,I am inclined to trust Yumi. Her personality is consistent with someone who would act impulsively to help.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"Thank you, George! I really am the Seer! Please, we have to vote for Takumi!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Takumi,,This is unfair! You're all just listening to her! I'm the one who's been honest this whole time!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"If Yumi is the werewolf, this is a masterstroke of deception. If she is the Seer, the wolf is caught.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,There are no counter-claims. Logic dictates we follow the only piece of evidence we have. I'm voting for Takumi.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
52,1,4,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
53,1,4,talk,George,,I agree. The risk of keeping a known werewolf is higher than the risk of executing a fake Seer.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
54,1,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
55,1,4,talk,Yumi,,Please believe me! I'm doing this for the village!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
56,1,4,pass,Yumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
57,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I can't believe this! You're all making a huge mistake!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
